{# Pin / unpin toggle for one export version — a POST (CSRF), never a GET
   link, because it changes shared state. Pinned versions sort first on every
   history surface and are never pruned.

   The controls have NO <form> element of their own: they are addressed to an
   out-of-line anchor form through the HTML `form` attribute, and the anchor
   is rendered ONCE per page by `_export_version_form_anchors.html.twig`,
   outside every other form. This toggle gets included INSIDE other forms (the
   group fill page's dropdown sits inside the fill form), and a nested
   <form> tag is not merely invalid: browsers AND libxml ignore the start tag
   and let its </form> close the OUTER form — which stranded every fill field
   of the group page outside its form (no pencils, previews and exports posted
   nothing; 2026-09-08).

   `turbo: true` marks the BUTTON Turbo-enabled as well: Turbo only takes over
   a submission when the form AND its submitter are navigatable, and under the
   site-wide `<html data-turbo="false">` the button — which sits in the page,
   not in the anchor — needs its own opt-in (the anchor carries the other).

   Expects:
   - version:       TemplateExportVersion (its anchor must be on the page)
   - redirect_url:  local path to return to after the toggle
   - tone:          optional extra class on the button (the pinned state
                    itself is `.on` — lavender, tilted pin)
   - turbo:         bool (default false) — see above #}
{% set turbo = turbo ?? false %}
{% set form_id = 'export-version-pin-' ~ version.id %}
{% set title = version.pinned ? 'Odepnout verzi' : 'Připnout verzi – zůstane nahoře v historii a nikdy se nepromaže' %}
<span class="fi-hpin" data-export-version-pin="{{ version.id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="_token" value="{{ csrf_token('template_export_version_pin') }}" form="{{ form_id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="pinned" value="{{ version.pinned ? '0' : '1' }}" form="{{ form_id }}">
    <input type="hidden" name="redirect" value="{{ redirect_url }}" form="{{ form_id }}">
    <button type="submit" form="{{ form_id }}" class="fi-hb{{ version.pinned ? ' on' }}{{ tone is defined ? ' ' ~ tone }}" title="{{ title }}" aria-label="{{ title }}" aria-pressed="{{ version.pinned ? 'true' : 'false' }}"{% if turbo %} data-turbo="true"{% endif %}>
        {{ icon('pin', 's14') }}
    </button>
</span>
